<title>THAILAND: Bank of Thailand denies offshore baht/dollar talk.</title>
<headline>Bank of Thailand denies offshore baht/dollar talk.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Thailand on Thursday denied market talk that it will buy dollars in the offshore markets at 24.00 baht.</p>
<p>A senior central bank official told Reuters that the talk was that the Bank of Thailand would make the move to help bail out speculators caught with short baht positions and who were now hit by capital controls imposed by the central bank.</p>
</text>
